{
    "title": "Nike: Shoes, Apparel & Stories",
    "description": "The Nike App is your personal guide to all things Nike \u2013 no matter your sport or style. Become a Member and get exclusive access to the latest Nike and Jordan products, Member Rewards, and personalized sport & style recommendations this holiday season. Shopping is seamless with the Nike App. Download today to start your holiday shopping, all with easy shipping and returns.\r\n \r\nSHOPPING AS IT SHOULD BE\r\nShop footwear, workout clothes & performance gear, streetwear favorites, accessories and more. Kid\u2019s, men's, or women's clothing \u2013 check out the latest with the Nike App.\r\n\u2022 Shop Sport - Shop gifts engineered to the exact specifications of championship athletes.\r\n\u2022 Member Benefits - Members get Free Shipping on Orders $50+, 60-day wear tests, and receiptless returns when you purchase through the app.\r\n\u2022 Member Profile - View Activity, orders, and purchase history for a seamless online shopping experience.\r\n\u2022 Member Promotions - Shop gifts and celebrate important moments with exclusive member rewards.\r\n\u2022 Shop Member Exclusive Products - Jordan or Nike, shopping is better as a Member. Unlock exclusive styles and first dibs on new, upcoming, and seasonal releases dropping weekly. Shop Jordan, Nike Dunk, and our newest innovations today.\r\n\u2022 Nike by You - Sneaker silhouettes are yours to design. Customize shoes and iconic Nike sneakers with colorways and materials that match your style.\r\n\u2022 Find a Store Near You - Experience the best of Nike in person.\r\n \r\nSERVICES THAT CONNECT & GUIDE YOU\r\nMore than just shopping. Get style tips or outfit advice \u2013 chat one-on-one with a Nike Expert. Receive training tips with your Nike community from wherever you are.\r\n\u2022 Training & Coaching for all - Expert advice delivered by Nike athletes, coaches, and personal trainers.\r\n\u2022 Nike Experts - Chat in real-time with our team on all things sport, streetwear, and Nike.\r\n\u2022 Exclusive Nike Experiences - Find events in your city. Join your Nike community.\r\n\u2022 Athlete Guidance - Get exclusive access to expert advice, personalized recommendations, and Member-only perks.\r\n \r\nSTORIES THAT INSPIRE & INFORM YOU\r\nIn-depth stories spanning across sport & culture, delivered daily. Follow your favorite athletes, sports teams, and products to get the most from the Nike App.\r\n\u2022 Member Home - Explore new, curated Nike stories, refreshed daily.\r\n\u2022 Notifications - Find the latest styles, hottest drops, athlete collaborations, events, and more by turning on push notifications.\r\n\u2022 Clothing & Sneaker Trends - Find new ways to wear your favorite Nike products.\r\n\u2022 Sportswear Collections - Learn what gear empowers the top Nike athletes.\r\n\r\nThe Nike App \u2013 Where all athletes belong. Download today.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Nike App is your personal guide to all things Nike \u2013 no matter your sport or style. Become a Member and get exclusive access to the latest Nike and Jordan products, Member Rewards, and personalized sport &amp; style recommendations this holiday season. Shopping is seamless with the Nike App. Download today to start your holiday shopping, all with easy shipping and returns.<br> <br>SHOPPING AS IT SHOULD BE<br>Shop footwear, workout clothes &amp; performance gear, streetwear favorites, accessories and more. Kid\u2019s, men&#39;s, or women&#39;s clothing \u2013 check out the latest with the Nike App.<br>\u2022 Shop Sport - Shop gifts engineered to the exact specifications of championship athletes.<br>\u2022 Member Benefits - Members get Free Shipping on Orders $50+, 60-day wear tests, and receiptless returns when you purchase through the app.<br>\u2022 Member Profile - View Activity, orders, and purchase history for a seamless online shopping experience.<br>\u2022 Member Promotions - Shop gifts and celebrate important moments with exclusive member rewards.<br>\u2022 Shop Member Exclusive Products - Jordan or Nike, shopping is better as a Member. Unlock exclusive styles and first dibs on new, upcoming, and seasonal releases dropping weekly. Shop Jordan, Nike Dunk, and our newest innovations today.<br>\u2022 Nike by You - Sneaker silhouettes are yours to design. Customize shoes and iconic Nike sneakers with colorways and materials that match your style.<br>\u2022 Find a Store Near You - Experience the best of Nike in person.<br> <br>SERVICES THAT CONNECT &amp; GUIDE YOU<br>More than just shopping. Get style tips or outfit advice \u2013 chat one-on-one with a Nike Expert. Receive training tips with your Nike community from wherever you are.<br>\u2022 Training &amp; Coaching for all - Expert advice delivered by Nike athletes, coaches, and personal trainers.<br>\u2022 Nike Experts - Chat in real-time with our team on all things sport, streetwear, and Nike.<br>\u2022 Exclusive Nike Experiences - Find events in your city. Join your Nike community.<br>\u2022 Athlete Guidance - Get exclusive access to expert advice, personalized recommendations, and Member-only perks.<br> <br>STORIES THAT INSPIRE &amp; INFORM YOU<br>In-depth stories spanning across sport &amp; culture, delivered daily. Follow your favorite athletes, sports teams, and products to get the most from the Nike App.<br>\u2022 Member Home - Explore new, curated Nike stories, refreshed daily.<br>\u2022 Notifications - Find the latest styles, hottest drops, athlete collaborations, events, and more by turning on push notifications.<br>\u2022 Clothing &amp; Sneaker Trends - Find new ways to wear your favorite Nike products.<br>\u2022 Sportswear Collections - Learn what gear empowers the top Nike athletes.<br><br>The Nike App \u2013 Where all athletes belong. Download today.",
